  "lead": "一滴黑漆在被切開後，長出更多的滴。迦梨沿著階梯、屋頂與廢軌尋找來源；每一次衣緣的接觸，都讓一段增生停在薄薄的乾片裡。",
  "lead_en": "A drop of black lacquer divides and grows new drops. Kali follows stairs, rooftops and abandoned rails toward its source. Each touch of her garment brings a stretch of multiplying lacquer to rest in thin, dry flakes.",
  "statement": "一滴黑漆在被切開後，長出更多的滴。迦梨沿著階梯、屋頂與廢軌尋找來源；每一次衣緣的接觸，都讓一段增生停在薄薄的乾片裡。\n\n迦梨終止增生的力量，是這本書的起點。她把不斷擴散的黑色留在衣上，讓道路重新容得下行走的人。亮滴成為乾片，孔雀綠逐漸覆黑；神性的行動留下重量，也為別人的日常留出空間。\n\n源盆空了，一片黑色留在砂上。她停下來看，然後繼續走。當蛾停在袖口，黑夜已能容納一個輕小的生命。",
  "statement_en": "A drop of black lacquer divides and grows new drops. Kali follows stairs, rooftops and abandoned rails toward its source. Each touch of her garment brings a stretch of multiplying lacquer to rest in thin, dry flakes.\n\nKali’s power to end multiplication is the starting point of this book. She takes the spreading blackness onto her clothes, making room for people to walk again. Glossy drops become dry flakes, and peacock green gradually turns black. Her divine action carries a weight of its own while opening space for the daily lives of others.\n\nThe source basin is empty. One black flake remains on the sand. She stops to watch, then walks on. When a moth rests on her cuff, the night has room for a small, delicate life.",
  "afterword": "源盆空了，一片黑色留在砂上。她停下來看，然後繼續走。當蛾停在袖口，黑夜已能容納一個輕小的生命。",
  "afterword_en": "The source basin is empty. One black flake remains on the sand. She stops to watch, then walks on. When a moth rests on her cuff, the night has room for a small, delicate life.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
